  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.0\n- Added [PrimitiveRequired] attribute.\n- Added [OpenApi.PrimitiveRequired.AllOf] attribute.\n- Added [OpenApi.PrimitiveRequired.AnyOf] attribute.\n- Added [OpenApi.PrimitiveRequired.OneOf] attribute.\nv2.0.6\n- Reduce required C# language version from 12 to 10.\nv2.0.5\n- Decorate all code with [ExcludeFromCodeCoverage].\nv2.0.4\n- Add <auto-generated/> tag to files.\n- Enable nullability in generated files.\n- Type references are now fully explicit from the global namespace to reduce potential conflicts.\nv2.0.3\n- Generate with #pragma warning disable headers.\nv2.0.2\n- Fix ambiguous reference issue if consuming project defines types with overlapping names.\n- Fix support for C# language version 9 and lower.\nv2.0.1\n- Fix NuGet version not actually generating source code.\nv2.0.0\n- Convert to source generator. #418\nv1.0.0\n- Initial version.",
